{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;El 39&quot; is a short horror experience set in the Buenos Aires neighborhood of Constituci\u00f3n in the early hours of the morning.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a guy who's just left a high school reunion party, completely defeated. The girl you liked back in school, once again, didn\u2019t even notice you. It\u2019s already 3 AM, and while trying not to overthink everything, you wander through the streets of Constituci\u00f3n, hoping to catch the last bus of line 39 that takes you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/e1ae2647cc5900eb8144fce7ad302f1e.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a terrifying encounter with a sock vendor, the 39 finally appears. You try to wave it down, but it drives right past you, leaving you stranded in the neighborhood. You have to find a way back\u2014tomorrow you take the exam that will determine whether you graduate or not. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/709e7049dce81b4a1f063b9c72279fd3.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The aesthetic of <i>&quot;El 39&quot;</i> is inspired by classic titles like <i>Silent Hill</i> and <i>Resident Evil</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/b66e0c407ee59ddd994b461733fff399.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is mixed with elements of Argentine popular culture found throughout the game, full of interactables and humor, giving way to what we call a \u201cpopcorn horror.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Graffiti</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/9e3075429d3592eb309d1851a700e688.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/b772aba2fc6a597a3b2e3b6970e1ee5d.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iconic (and explorable) places like Ugi\u2019s</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/75bdc8d464ca5c929511ba9929a0ca10.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And so much more!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/401ba4d35ae949adabc700843d37b229.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Missed the bus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3900380/a5f8a3669adb5af598bc4d4491470121daaa9856.jpg"},{"name":"The munchies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3900380/4c2d410802c82586de2300fbeb64555113fd4282.jpg"},{"name":"Homecoming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3900380/e1aaf2dbc50382a5ce293082baa93176fb98c6fa.jpg"},{"name":"Mauro Albarrac\u00edn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3900380/2e8920c0587a276ddd3864e86c8ad1dd448f6e11.jpg"},{"name":"Say no more","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3900380